        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: August Wilson, Robert Gossett, Lloyd Richards, Hal Scott, Donald McKayle\n- Works: Fences, The Pittsburgh Cycle, A Raisin in the Sun, The Last Minstrel Show\n- Topics: American playwriting, Broadway\n\nFacts:\n- August Wilson was born on April 27, 1945, and died on October 2, 2005.\n- August Wilson was an American playwright whose work included the ten-play series The Pittsburgh Cycle.\n- August Wilson received two Pulitzer Prizes for Drama for his playwriting.\n- Fences is a 1985 play by American playwright August Wilson.\n- Robert Gossett acted in the Broadway production of Lloyd Richards's Fences.\n- Robert Gossett also acted in Hal Scott's A Raisin in the Sun and Donald McKayle's The Last Minstrel Show.",
